<title>USA: Milton Area School Dist, Pa., adjusted TIC.</title>
<headline>Milton Area School Dist, Pa., adjusted TIC.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Milton Area School District, Pa., said on Tuesday it recalculated PaineWebber Inc's winning bid for the District's $9.995 million general obligation bond issue.</p>
<p>The District said the true interest cost was 5.201 percent reflecting the cost of bond insurance, MBIA, not the 5.18 percent originally calculated.</p>
